*.pyc

# Consumer-side install state (regenerated by: npx skills add <repo>)
.claude/skills/
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# CLI 在仓库内执行安装时产生的消费者工件(非包源码):
# agent/skills/ 副本 + skills/ 下与技能同名的顶层符号链接(OpenClaw 等 agent 目录)
agent/
skills/*
!skills/en/
